			"Message": "fix(Mountain): Add default configuration options to Info.plist\n\nSigned-off-by: Nikola Hristov <Nikola@PlayForm.Cloud>",
			"SHA": "4b43c376835eb7089928494f7ed9090eeb9e5737"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
